  - endorse(working_proposal, conditions?) — accept the current draft, optionally with conditions.
  - object(working_proposal, reason, willing_to_yield) — reject, with whether you'd yield if conditions improved.
  - ask_clarification(participant_id, question) — request specifics from another participant.

